{
  "key": 37955,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome to the Battle Castle!\r",
        "I am your guide to the Single and\n",
        "Double Battle challenges.\r",
        "Please be aware that these challenges\n",
        "are designed for a single Trainer.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Which challenge would you\n",
        "like to take? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "At the Battle Castle, you may take a\n",
        "Single or Double Battle challenge.\r",
        "Here, you are provided with Castle\n",
        "Points (CP) that you must manage.\r",
        "The CP are used for healing Pokémon,\n",
        "renting items or Berries, and so on.\r",
        "CP are earned by winning matches.\n",
        "The amount varies by how you win.\r",
        "The objective is to keep a winning\n",
        "streak alive while managing your CP.\r",
        "If you manage to win seven matches in\n",
        "a row, you will earn Battle Points (BP).\r",
        "If you want to interrupt your\n",
        "challenge, please save the game.\r",
        "If you don’t save, you will be\n",
        "disqualified from your challenge.\r",
        "Please be aware of that!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome to the Battle Castle!\r",
        "I am your guide to the Multi Battle\n",
        "challenge.\r",
        "Please be aware that this challenge\n",
        "requires two Trainers.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Would you like to take the Battle\n",
        "Castle Multi Battle challenge? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "You may team up with a friend for a\n",
        "Multi Battle challenge.\r",
        "Both Trainers are provided with Castle\n",
        "Points (CP) that must be managed.\r",
        "The CP is used for healing Pokémon,\n",
        "renting items or Berries, and so on.\r",
        "Trainers can use their CP on not only\n",
        "their own Pokémon, but also their\f",
        "partner’s.\r",
        "Both Trainers earn CP by winning\n",
        "matches.\r",
        "The objective is to keep a winning\n",
        "streak alive while managing your CP.\r",
        "If you manage to win seven matches in\n",
        "a row, you will earn Battle Points (BP).\r",
        "Please note: a Battle Castle Multi\n",
        "Battle challenge can’t be interrupted.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00006",
      "en_US": "We hope to see you again!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Please select the Pokémon you wish\n",
        "to enter.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Excuse me!\r",
        "You don’t have {STRVAR_1 50, 0, 0} eligible Pokémon.\r",
        "You must have {STRVAR_1 50, 1, 0} different Pokémon\n",
        "to enter.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00009",
      "en_US": "Also, Eggs are ineligible to enter.\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Eggs and {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0} are not allowed\n",
