    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00028",
      "en_US": "Please come see me when you are ready.\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00029",
      "en_US": [
        "Both Trainers have chosen the\n",
        "Pokémon {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}.\r",
        "Please confer with the other Trainer\n",
        "and choose different Pokémon.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00030",
      "en_US": [
        "Both Trainers have chosen the Pokémon\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} and {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}.\r",
        "Please confer with the other Trainer\n",
        "and choose different Pokémon.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00031",
      "en_US": [
        "You must save the game before I\n",
        "show you in. Is that OK? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00032",
      "en_US": "Right this way, please!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00033",
      "en_US": [
        "We’ve missed you!\r",
        "You must save the game before you\n",
        "resume your challenge. Please wait."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00034",
      "en_US": [
        "Excuse me!\r",
        "You didn’t save before you quit your\n",
        "challenge last time.\r",
        "Because of that, you have been\n",
        "disqualified from your challenge!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00035",
      "en_US": [
        "Congratulations!\r",
        "In recognition of your victory, we\n",
        "present you with a commemorative print!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00036",
      "en_US": [
        "The Gold Print was added to\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Vs. Recorder!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00037",
      "en_US": [
        "The Silver Print was added to\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Vs. Recorder!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00038",
      "en_US": "SINGLE BATTLE"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00039",
      "en_US": "DOUBLE BATTLE"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00040",
      "en_US": "TAKE CHALLENGE"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00041",
      "en_US": "INFO"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00042",
      "en_US": "CANCEL"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00043",
      "en_US": [
        "One Trainer should select\n",
        "“BECOME LEADER.”\r",
        "The other Trainer must select\n",
        "“JOIN GROUP.” {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00044",
      "en_US": [
        "We need to launch DS Wireless\n",
        "Communications. {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00045",
      "en_US": [
        "You must save the game before\n",
        "I show you in. Please wait."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00046",
      "en_US": [
        "Listen carefully!\r",
        "If your Pokémon win without taking\n",
        "damage, you earn more CP.\f",
        "The more, the merrier!\f",
        "Look at me. I don’t have much..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00047",
      "en_US": [
        "Listen!\r",
        "You can earn more Castle Points or CP\n",
        "by facing higher-level opponents.\r",
        "This is what they call high risk,\n",
        "high return!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00048",
      "en_US": [
        "Before every battle, you should check\n",
        "the opponent’s lineup.\r",
        "Don’t be cheap with your CP.\n",
        "It’s like that old saying goes about\f",
        "knowing your enemy.\r",
        "“Unless you enter the enemy’s lair,\n",
        "you cannot take their prize.”\r",
        "...\f",
        "That’s not the right old saying!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00049",
      "en_US": [
        "Mr. Darach...\r",
        "His feelings for Lady Caitlin are\n",
        "all bottled up...\r",
        "Oh, how I pine for him..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00050",
      "en_US": [
        "At first, you can only use CP for\n",
        "restoring HP.\r",
        "But you can spend CP to rank up.\n",
        "Then, you can even restore PP!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00051",
      "en_US": [
        "If you lose, your entire stock of CP\n",
        "is cleaned out to zero!\r",
        "This is the rule at the Battle Castle."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0109_D32R0501_00052",
      "en_US": [
        "My dream is to wear a beautiful dress\n",
        "and live in a castle!\r",
        "That’s not what I meant to say...\r",
        "My dream is to live in a castle with\n",
        "someone who wears a beautiful dress!"
      ]
    }
  ]
